  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please reconsider VRChat’s reliance on Epic Online Services (EOS).\n\nEOS has proven to be an increasingly unreliable dependency. Login failures caused by EOS outages or overloads happen repeatedly and prevent users from accessing VRChat, even when Steam authentication and VRChat’s own services are functioning correctly.\n\nThese issues are outside of the user’s control and result in poor user experience, especially when no clear error message is shown and the client remains stuck at the login screen.\n\nIf EOS continues to be unstable, VRChat should strongly consider reducing its dependency on EOS or switching to a more reliable partner. Valve’s infrastructure would be one possible example of a proven and stable alternative.",
